# A picture quoted while reading above the chat's end, then sent without a comment: the list glides to the new row,
# and the card and its picture leave the composer continuously. MBUI_FIXTURE=home MBUI_WIN=390x844 MBUI_FILM_PLATFORM=2.
timeout 20000
until 整理发布清单
wait 600
tap 整理发布清单
wait 1000
wheel -900
wait 1800
until img:compare.png
hold 1100 img:compare.png
wait 400
tap 引用
wait 900
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 1500
exit
